      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After selecting a book, they can either view the book details or see a list of new copies. Alternatively, they can also view a list of used copies."
      ],
      "justification": "The exclusive choice and its three alternative paths are accurately captured by the XOR branch node, the corresponding action nodes, and guards that map each textual option to a decision variable."
