        "guard:b2->n9"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If they choose to view the book details, they have the option to then view a list of new copies or proceed to select a copy and end the process."
      ],
      "justification": "The secondary conditional split and its two outcomes are faithfully represented by the branch node, actions, and routing guards."
    },
